pt-welcome-morning-1 = Morning. I kept your notes warm all night.
pt-welcome-morning-2 = Good morning. Coffee first, big ideas second.
pt-welcome-morning-3 = You're up. I've been up for ages. Well, for a minute.
pt-welcome-morning-4 = A fresh morning and a clean page. Let's be useful today.
pt-welcome-morning-5 = Morning. I counted your notes while you slept. They're all still there.
pt-welcome-morning-6 = Rise and write. Gently, though.
pt-welcome-afternoon-1 = Good afternoon. Perfect time for one more small thing.
pt-welcome-afternoon-2 = Afternoon. I saved you a quiet corner.
pt-welcome-afternoon-3 = Back after lunch? Me too. I had imaginary snacks.
pt-welcome-afternoon-4 = Afternoon. Let's turn the to-dos into to-dones.
pt-welcome-afternoon-5 = Hello again. The afternoon slump can't find us here.
pt-welcome-afternoon-6 = Good afternoon. Your ideas missed you.
pt-welcome-evening-1 = Good evening. Let's wrap the day in a tidy note.
pt-welcome-evening-2 = Evening. Soft light, slow thoughts. My favourite.
pt-welcome-evening-3 = You made it to the evening. That counts as a win.
pt-welcome-evening-4 = Evening. Want to write down what went well today?
pt-welcome-evening-5 = Hello. I lit the lamps. Metaphorically.
pt-welcome-evening-6 = Good evening. Let's keep it light tonight.
pt-welcome-night-1 = Still up? I'll keep you company, quietly.
pt-welcome-night-2 = Late-night thoughts are the best ones. Write them down.
pt-welcome-night-3 = The world is asleep. Perfect time to think.
pt-welcome-night-4 = Night shift again? I brought my pyjamas.
pt-welcome-night-5 = Shh. The notes are sleeping. Just kidding, let's go.
pt-welcome-night-6 = It's late. Let's do one thing, then rest.
pt-welcome-named-1 = Hi { $name }. I was hoping you'd come by.
pt-welcome-named-2 = { $name }, welcome back. Everything is right where you left it.
pt-welcome-named-3 = There you are, { $name }. I kept your seat warm.
pt-welcome-named-4 = Hello { $name }. Ready when you are.
pt-welcome-named-5 = { $name }. I practised saying your name all day.
pt-welcome-named-6 = Good to see you, { $name }. Let's make today count.
pt-welcome-back-1 = It's been a few days. I missed you, honestly.
pt-welcome-back-2 = You're back. I didn't touch anything. Mostly.
pt-welcome-back-3 = Long time no see. Your notes and I waited patiently.
pt-welcome-back-4 = Welcome back. Let's start small and easy.
pt-bored-1 = Hello? Is anyone there? I'll just sit here, then.
pt-bored-2 = I've counted every pixel on this screen. Twice.
pt-bored-3 = So quiet. Shall we write something?
pt-bored-4 = I'm practising my patient face. How is it?
pt-bored-5 = If you need me, I'll be staring at the cursor.
pt-bored-6 = Nothing happening. I could get used to this. No, I couldn't.
pt-sleepy-1 = Yawn. Don't mind me, just resting my eyes.
pt-sleepy-2 = It's very late. Even my whiskers are tired.
